@startuml
 title sd — Validate a main push
 actor Contributor
 participant GitHub
 participant "Hosted test jobs" as Tests
 participant "Isolated local scan runner" as Runner
 participant SonarQube
 Contributor -> GitHub: Push exact main SHA
 GitHub -> Tests: Test and collect coverage for SHA
 alt Tests fail
 Tests --> GitHub: Failed checks
 else Tests pass
 Tests --> GitHub: SHA-bound coverage artifacts
 GitHub -> Runner: Schedule trusted main scan
 Runner -> GitHub: Fetch same SHA and coverage
 Runner -> Runner: Validate report paths and identity
 Runner -> SonarQube: Submit analysis using project token
 Runner -> SonarQube: Await gate with bounded timeout
 alt Gate computed
 SonarQube --> Runner: Gate status
 Runner --> GitHub: Pass or fail matching gate
 else Authentication, connectivity or timeout failure
 Runner --> GitHub: Failed or inconclusive check
 end
 end
 note over Runner
No fork or PR execution
No workstation mounts or Docker socket
end note
@enduml
